{"html":"<!doctype html>\n<html lang=\"en\"><head><meta charset=\"UTF-8\"><meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1,viewport-fit=cover\"><link rel=\"manifest\" href=\"manifest.json\"><link rel=\"apple-touch-icon\" href=\"icons/icon-180.png\"><meta name=\"apple-mobile-web-app-capable\" content=\"yes\"><meta name=\"apple-mobile-web-app-title\" content=\"Chord Sketch\"><meta name=\"apple-mobile-web-app-status-bar-style\" content=\"default\"><meta name=\"application-name\" content=\"Chord Sketch\"><meta name=\"theme-color\" content=\"#f7f4ee\"><title>Chord Sketch — Start with a feeling</title><meta name=\"description\" content=\"Find a chord progression, hear your idea, and take editable MIDI chords, bass and melody into GarageBand.\"><link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"style.css?v=offline8\"></head>\n<body><div class=\"shell\"><header><a class=\"brand\" href=\"./\"><span class=\"mark\">♬</span> Chord Sketch</a><span class=\"header-note\">A little space for your next song</span></header><section class=\"top-transport\" aria-label=\"Sketch playback controls\"><div class=\"top-transport-row\"><div class=\"top-transport-buttons\"><button id=\"top-rewind\" class=\"transport-control\" aria-label=\"Rewind sketch to the beginning\" title=\"Rewind to start\">⏮ <span>Start</span></button><button id=\"top-prev\" class=\"transport-control\" aria-label=\"Go to the previous bar\" title=\"Previous bar\">◀ <span>Bar</span></button><button id=\"top-play\" class=\"primary\" aria-label=\"Play sketch\" aria-pressed=\"false\">▶ Play</button><button id=\"top-stop\" class=\"transport-control\" aria-label=\"Stop playback and return to the beginning\">■ <span>Stop</span></button><button id=\"top-next\" class=\"transport-control\" aria-label=\"Go to the next bar\" title=\"Next bar\"><span>Bar</span> ▶</button></div><div class=\"transport-tool-actions\"><button id=\"top-performance\" class=\"transport-control\">Performance</button><button id=\"top-new\" class=\"transport-control\">Clear &amp; start afresh</button><button id=\"top-collapse\" class=\"transport-control\">Collapse all</button></div><div class=\"top-position\"><span id=\"top-bar\">Bar 1 / 8</span><output id=\"top-time\">0:00 / 0:22</output></div></div><div id=\"reset-confirm\" class=\"reset-confirm\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"Confirm starting afresh\" hidden><p>Clear the current music, imported audio, locks, saved theme, arrangement and recorded performance? Loaded SoundFonts stay available.</p><div><button id=\"reset-cancel\" class=\"secondary\">Cancel</button><button id=\"reset-now\" class=\"primary\">Clear &amp; start afresh</button></div><p class=\"tiny\">Undo can restore the musical sketch. The imported audio file would need to be selected again.</p></div><div class=\"transport-parts\" aria-label=\"Parts to play\"><label><input id=\"top-part-chords\" type=\"checkbox\" checked><span>Chords</span></label><label><input id=\"top-part-bass\" type=\"checkbox\" checked><span>Bass</span></label><label><input id=\"top-part-melody\" type=\"checkbox\" checked><span>Melody</span></label><label><input id=\"top-part-drums\" type=\"checkbox\"><span>Drums</span></label></div><input id=\"top-seek\" class=\"top-seek\" type=\"range\" min=\"0\" max=\"32\" step=\"0.25\" value=\"0\" aria-label=\"Seek sketch playback position in beats\"></section>\n<main><div class=\"intro\"><div><p class=\"eyebrow\">THE SONG STARTS HERE</p><h1>An idea.<br><span>A song.</span></h1><p class=\"lede\">Start simply. Let the music develop. Shape it when you want to.</p></div></div>\n\n<section class=\"studio\" aria-label=\"Songwriting sketchpad\"><div class=\"studio-top\"><div><span class=\"eyebrow\">YOUR SKETCH</span><h2 id=\"summary\">A minor · Mellow</h2></div><span id=\"saved\" class=\"save-state\" role=\"status\">Saved on this device</span></div><div class=\"quick-workflow\" aria-label=\"Simple songwriting workflow\"><section class=\"quick-step\"><span class=\"step-number\">1</span><h3>Start an idea</h3><p>Choose a feeling, then try an idea or bring your own.</p><div class=\"settings\"><label>Root note<select id=\"key\" aria-label=\"Root note\"></select></label><label>Scale<select id=\"mode\"><option value=\"minor\">Minor</option><option value=\"major\">Major</option></select></label><label>Feeling<select id=\"mood\"><option value=\"mellow\">Mellow</option><option value=\"uplifting\">Uplifting</option><option value=\"tense\">Tense</option></select></label><label class=\"tempo-label\">Tempo <span><output id=\"bpm\">86</output> BPM</span><input id=\"tempo\" type=\"range\" min=\"50\" max=\"160\" value=\"86\" aria-label=\"Tempo in beats per minute\"></label></div><p class=\"quick-band-label\">Include in your idea</p><div class=\"quick-parts\"><label class=\"toggle\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"bass\" checked><span class=\"switch\"></span> Bass</label><label class=\"toggle\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"melody\" checked><span class=\"switch\"></span> Melody</label><label class=\"toggle\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"drums\"><span class=\"switch\"></span> Drums</label></div><div class=\"quick-start-actions\"><button id=\"generate\" class=\"primary\">New idea</button><button id=\"quick-type-chords\" class=\"text-button\">Type chords</button><button id=\"quick-import\" class=\"text-button\">Import a melody</button></div></section><section class=\"quick-step quick-develop\"><span class=\"step-number\">2</span><h3>Make it a song</h3><p>Develop your melody into sections and arrange them automatically.</p><label>Melody to use<select id=\"quick-source\"><option value=\"current\">Current melody · up to 4 bars</option><option value=\"saved\">Saved original theme</option></select></label><label>Character<select id=\"quick-character\"><option value=\"gentle\">Small &amp; gentle</option><option value=\"balanced\" selected>Balanced</option><option value=\"lively\">More energy</option></select></label><button id=\"quick-build\" class=\"primary\">Make a song</button><p class=\"tiny\">Captures the theme, develops four sections and builds a song order. Undo returns to your previous sketch.</p></section><section class=\"quick-step quick-export\"><span class=\"step-number\">3</span><h3>Listen &amp; keep it</h3><p>Use Play at the top. When you like it, export the editable tracks.</p><button id=\"export\" class=\"export-button\">Export MIDI</button><p id=\"export-status\" role=\"status\" class=\"tiny\"></p><div id=\"export-results\" class=\"export-results\" hidden><p id=\"midi-filename\" class=\"tiny\"></p><div class=\"export-save-actions\"><a id=\"midi-download\" class=\"midi-download\" download>↓ Download MIDI</a><button id=\"midi-share\" class=\"secondary\" hidden>Share / Save to Files</button></div><p class=\"tiny\">On iPad or iPhone, choose Save to Files in the share menu. If saving is blocked inside another app, <a href=\"./\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">open Chord Sketch in your browser</a> and export there.</p></div><button id=\"quick-offline\" class=\"text-button\">Install / offline</button><span id=\"offline-badge\" class=\"offline-badge\" role=\"status\">Offline setup available</span><button id=\"quick-sound\" class=\"text-button\">Sound &amp; instruments</button><button id=\"quick-export-help\" class=\"text-button\">How to use the MIDI file</button></section></div><div class=\"quick-result\"><div class=\"quick-result-heading\"><h3 id=\"quick-result-title\">Your sketch</h3><div class=\"edit-history\"><button id=\"edit-undo\" class=\"secondary\" disabled>↶ Undo</button><button id=\"edit-redo\" class=\"secondary\" disabled>↷ Redo</button></div></div><p id=\"quick-summary\" class=\"tiny\"></p><div id=\"quick-overview\" class=\"quick-overview\" aria-label=\"Song overview\"></div><p id=\"quick-status\" class=\"quick-status\" role=\"status\">Choose New idea, or turn the melody you already have into a song.</p><p id=\"edit-history-status\" class=\"tiny\" role=\"status\">Undo keeps the last 40 edits in this session.</p><p id=\"audio-status\" class=\"audio-status\" role=\"status\">Soft keys preview · 4/4 time · 8 bars</p></div><div class=\"tools-heading\"><div><h3>Shape it when you want to</h3><p>Open just the tools you need.</p></div><button id=\"quick-show-tools\" class=\"secondary\" aria-expanded=\"false\">Show all tools</button></div><div id=\"advanced-tools\" class=\"advanced-tools\"><details id=\"tool-app\" class=\"advanced-tool\"><summary><strong>iPad app &amp; offline</strong><span>Install on your Home Screen and download the app</span></summary><div class=\"tool-body offline-panel\"><h3>Keep Chord Sketch on your iPad</h3><ol><li>Open <a href=\"./\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Chord Sketch in Safari</a> and sign in if prompted.</li><li>Tap Share → Add to Home Screen. Turn on Open as Web App if shown, then tap Add.</li><li>Open the new Chord Sketch icon while online, then tap Prepare for offline use here.</li></ol><p class=\"tiny\">This smaller edition includes the app and built-in sounds. Load your own SoundFont for sampled instruments. Your imported files, playback, editing, MIDI and WAV export run on this device. Your own SoundFonts are remembered separately after you load them.</p><div class=\"offline-actions\"><button id=\"offline-prepare\" class=\"primary\">Prepare for offline use</button><button id=\"offline-update\" class=\"secondary\" hidden>Save &amp; update app</button><button id=\"offline-remove\" class=\"secondary\" disabled>Remove offline download</button></div><p id=\"offline-status\" role=\"status\" class=\"tiny\">Checking offline support…</p><p class=\"tiny\">Wait for Ready offline, then check it by opening the Home Screen app in Airplane Mode. Prepare from the Home Screen app itself. Clearing website data or removing the download removes offline availability; keep important work exported.</p></div></details><details id=\"tool-performance\" class=\"advanced-tool\"><summary><strong>Performance</strong><span>Shape the band with three controls and record a take</span></summary><div class=\"tool-body performance-panel\"><h3>Play it your way</h3><label class=\"toggle\"><input id=\"performance-enabled\" type=\"checkbox\"> Use performance mode</label><p class=\"tiny\">Energy shapes dynamics and accompaniment density. Space lets the melody breathe. Variation adds phrase swells and restrained bass answers and drum fills. Your written melody, protected notes and locked parts are kept.</p><div class=\"performance-controls\"><label>Energy <output id=\"performance-energy-value\">50%</output><input id=\"performance-energy\" type=\"range\" min=\"0\" max=\"100\" value=\"50\"></label><label>Space <output id=\"performance-space-value\">0%</output><input id=\"performance-space\" type=\"range\" min=\"0\" max=\"100\" value=\"0\"></label><label>Variation <output id=\"performance-variation-value\">0%</output><input id=\"performance-variation\" type=\"range\" min=\"0\" max=\"100\" value=\"0\"></label></div><div class=\"performance-actions\"><button id=\"performance-record\" class=\"primary\">● Record performance</button><button id=\"performance-reset\" class=\"secondary\">Reset controls</button><button id=\"performance-clear\" class=\"secondary\">Clear recorded take</button></div><label class=\"toggle\"><input id=\"performance-use-take\" type=\"checkbox\"> Play recorded take</label><p id=\"performance-status\" class=\"tiny\" role=\"status\">Press Play and move the controls, or record a take from the beginning.</p><p class=\"tiny\">Recording captures these three controls across the sketch. Stop &amp; keep saves the take; pause or reaching the end also keeps it. MIDI and WAV use the same performance. Sound choices and part switches use their current settings.</p></div></details><details id=\"tool-sound\" class=\"advanced-tool\"><summary><strong>Sound</strong><span>SoundFonts, instruments, mixer and WAV export</span></summary><div class=\"tool-body sound-panel\"><h3>Give it your sound</h3><p>Use the included bank, or load an SF2 / SF3 SoundFont from Files. SoundFont audio is generated on this device.</p><label>When loading<select id=\"sound-load-action\"><option value=\"add\">Add bank alongside existing banks</option><option value=\"replace\">Replace all loaded banks</option></select></label><div class=\"sound-bank-controls\"><button hidden id=\"sound-load-default\" class=\"primary\">Included bank unavailable in this edition</button><label class=\"file-label\">Load my SoundFont<input id=\"sound-font-file\" type=\"file\" accept=\".sf2,.sf3\"></label><label>Loaded bank<select id=\"sound-bank-select\"></select></label><button id=\"sound-remove-bank\" class=\"secondary\" disabled>Remove bank</button></div><p id=\"sound-bank-name\" class=\"tiny\">Built-in sounds</p><label>Playback sound<select id=\"sound-mode\"><option value=\"studio\">Built-in piano &amp; bass</option><option value=\"soundfont\">SoundFont instruments</option><option value=\"classic\">Classic tones</option></select></label><p id=\"sound-status\" class=\"tiny\" role=\"status\">The included GeneralUser GS Starter bank has 10 instruments, is about 9 MB and loads only when you choose it. Load up to four banks, then choose an instrument from any bank for each part. Each bank can be up to 80 MB; all banks together up to 120 MB.</p><div class=\"sound-parts\"><article class=\"sound-part\"><h4>Chords</h4><label>Instrument<select id=\"sound-instrument-chords\"><option value=\"builtin\">Built-in fallback</option></select></label><label>Volume <output id=\"sound-volume-value-chords\">100%</output><input id=\"sound-volume-chords\" type=\"range\" min=\"0\" max=\"100\" step=\"1\" value=\"100\"></label><label>Pan <output id=\"sound-pan-value-chords\">Centre</output><input id=\"sound-pan-chords\" type=\"range\" min=\"-100\" max=\"100\" step=\"5\" value=\"0\"></label><button id=\"sound-test-chords\" class=\"secondary\">Test chords</button></article><article class=\"sound-part\"><h4>Bass</h4><label>Instrument<select id=\"sound-instrument-bass\"><option value=\"builtin\">Built-in fallback</option></select></label><label>Volume <output id=\"sound-volume-value-bass\">100%</output><input id=\"sound-volume-bass\" type=\"range\" min=\"0\" max=\"100\" step=\"1\" value=\"100\"></label><label>Pan <output id=\"sound-pan-value-bass\">Centre</output><input id=\"sound-pan-bass\" type=\"range\" min=\"-100\" max=\"100\" step=\"5\" value=\"0\"></label><button id=\"sound-test-bass\" class=\"secondary\">Test bass</button></article><article class=\"sound-part\"><h4>Melody</h4><label>Instrument<select id=\"sound-instrument-melody\"><option value=\"builtin\">Built-in fallback</option></select></label><label>Volume <output id=\"sound-volume-value-melody\">100%</output><input id=\"sound-volume-melody\" type=\"range\" min=\"0\" max=\"100\" step=\"1\" value=\"100\"></label><label>Pan <output id=\"sound-pan-value-melody\">Centre</output><input id=\"sound-pan-melody\" type=\"range\" min=\"-100\" max=\"100\" step=\"5\" value=\"0\"></label><button id=\"sound-test-melody\" class=\"secondary\">Test melody</button></article><article class=\"sound-part\"><h4>Drums</h4><label>Instrument<select id=\"sound-instrument-drums\"><option value=\"builtin\">Built-in fallback</option></select></label><label>Volume <output id=\"sound-volume-value-drums\">100%</output><input id=\"sound-volume-drums\" type=\"range\" min=\"0\" max=\"100\" step=\"1\" value=\"100\"></label><label>Pan <output id=\"sound-pan-value-drums\">Centre</output><input id=\"sound-pan-drums\" type=\"range\" min=\"-100\" max=\"100\" step=\"5\" value=\"0\"></label><button id=\"sound-test-drums\" class=\"secondary\">Test drums</button></article></div><label class=\"sound-room\">Room / reverb <output id=\"sound-room-value\">25%</output><input id=\"sound-room\" type=\"range\" min=\"0\" max=\"100\" step=\"1\" value=\"25\"></label><p class=\"tiny\">Room applies to SoundFont instruments. Banks without a selected sound for a part use the built-in fallback. A loaded bank is remembered locally when browser storage allows it.</p><div class=\"sound-export\"><button id=\"sound-wav\" class=\"primary\" disabled>Export audio WAV</button><button id=\"sound-cancel-wav\" class=\"secondary\" hidden>Cancel render</button><p id=\"sound-wav-status\" class=\"tiny\" role=\"status\">Load a SoundFont to export stereo WAV audio. MIDI remains available from the main screen and includes your instrument choices and mix. SoundFont samples are included in WAV audio, not embedded in MIDI.</p><div id=\"sound-wav-result\" hidden><a id=\"sound-wav-link\" class=\"midi-download\" download>Download WAV</a><button id=\"sound-wav-share\" class=\"secondary\" hidden>Share / Save to Files</button></div></div><p class=\"tiny sound-credits\">Sound engine: <a href=\"https://github.com/spessasus/spessasynth_lib\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">SpessaSynth</a> · Included bank: <a href=\"https://schristiancollins.com/generaluser.php\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">GeneralUser GS Starter · adapted from S. Christian Collins</a> · <a href=\"soundfonts/GeneralUser-GS-LICENSE.txt\" target=\"_blank\">Bank licence</a> · <a href=\"vendor/spessasynth/LICENSE\" target=\"_blank\">Engine licence</a></p></div></details><details id=\"tool-chords\" class=\"advanced-tool\"><summary><strong>Chords</strong><span>Type a progression and edit voicings</span></summary><div class=\"tool-body\"><section class=\"custom-panel\" aria-labelledby=\"custom-title\"><label id=\"custom-title\" for=\"progression\">Write your own progression</label><p id=\"chord-help\">One chord per bar, up to 32 bars. Use commas or spaces: A, Am, Amaj7, A7, Bm, Bbdim, C#m, D, Dmaj7, Ddim, E, E6, F#m.</p><div class=\"progression-entry\"><textarea id=\"progression\" rows=\"2\" spellcheck=\"false\" autocapitalize=\"off\" aria-describedby=\"chord-help chord-status\"></textarea><button id=\"apply-chords\" class=\"primary\">Apply chords</button></div><p class=\"tiny\" id=\"chord-status\" role=\"status\">Supports major, minor, 7, maj7, m7, 6, diminished, sus, augmented, add9 and slash chords.</p><p class=\"tiny\">Root and scale guide generated chords. Typed chords keep their pitches. “Try another idea” changes unlocked parts and keeps the number of bars.</p></section><div class=\"sequence-heading\"><span>CHORD PROGRESSION</span><span>Tap to hear a bar · type a chord or use the menu</span></div><p class=\"voicing-hint\">Inversions move chord tones to change the voicing. Bass notes are controlled separately.</p><div id=\"chords\" class=\"chords\"></div></div></details><details id=\"tool-notes\" class=\"advanced-tool\"><summary><strong>Melody & bass</strong><span>Piano roll, octaves and note editing</span></summary><div class=\"tool-body\"><section class=\"note-editor-panel\" aria-labelledby=\"note-title\"><h3 id=\"note-title\">Shape the notes and their lengths</h3><p>Edit precise starts and held notes for melody or bass. Start beats count from 0 across the whole sketch. Show several bars together to see the phrase. Notes held across bar lines stay connected.</p><div class=\"note-editor-settings\"><label>Part<select id=\"note-part\"><option value=\"melody\">Melody</option><option value=\"bass\">Bass</option></select></label><label>Start / edit bar<select id=\"note-bar\"></select></label><button id=\"add-note\" class=\"secondary\">Add note</button><button id=\"reset-note-bar\" class=\"secondary\">Use grid for this bar</button></div><p class=\"tiny\">Choose Place notes and tap empty space to add a note, or use Add note. Double-click also works with a mouse. Drag a note to change pitch or timing. Drag its right edge to resize. Arrow keys move a focused note; Shift + left/right changes its length. Direct edits also work on locked notes.</p><div class=\"roll-navigation\"><label>Bars to show<select id=\"roll-view\"><option value=\"1\">1 bar</option><option value=\"2\">2 bars</option><option value=\"4\" selected>4 bars</option><option value=\"8\">8 bars</option><option value=\"all\">Whole sketch</option></select></label><div class=\"roll-page-buttons\"><button id=\"roll-prev\" class=\"secondary\" aria-label=\"Previous bars in piano roll\">◀ Previous</button><button id=\"roll-next\" class=\"secondary\" aria-label=\"Next bars in piano roll\">Next ▶</button></div><span id=\"roll-range\" class=\"tiny\" role=\"status\"></span></div><p class=\"tiny\">The piano roll and note table show the selected range. Add note and Use grid apply to the Start / edit bar. Wider views can scroll horizontally.</p><div class=\"roll-tools\"><label>Touch tool<select id=\"roll-touch-tool\"><option value=\"select\">Select &amp; drag</option><option value=\"place\">Place notes</option></select></label><label>Snap<select id=\"roll-snap\"><option value=\"120\">1/16 note</option><option value=\"240\">1/8 note</option><option value=\"60\">1/32 note</option></select></label><label>Selected note velocity<input id=\"roll-velocity\" type=\"number\" min=\"1\" max=\"127\" value=\"80\" step=\"1\" disabled></label><button id=\"roll-delete\" class=\"secondary\" disabled>Delete selected</button></div><p id=\"roll-selected\" class=\"tiny\"></p><div id=\"roll-scroll\" class=\"roll-scroll\"><div id=\"piano-roll\" class=\"piano-roll\" aria-label=\"Piano roll for selected part and bar\"></div></div><p id=\"note-mode\" class=\"tiny\"></p><div class=\"note-table-scroll\"><table class=\"note-table\"><thead><tr><th>Pitch</th><th>Start beat (from 0)</th><th>Length (beats)</th><th></th></tr></thead><tbody id=\"note-rows\"></tbody></table></div><p id=\"note-status\" class=\"tiny\" role=\"status\"></p></section><section class=\"melody-panel\" aria-labelledby=\"melody-title\"><div class=\"melody-heading\"><div><h3 id=\"melody-title\">A melody to build on</h3><p id=\"melody-help\">Four beats per bar · change any note, or choose a rest.</p></div><button id=\"new-melody\" class=\"secondary\">↻ &nbsp; Try another melody</button></div><div class=\"octave-toolbar\"><div><strong>Whole melody</strong><span id=\"octave-range\"></span></div><div class=\"octave-actions\"><button id=\"octave-down\" class=\"secondary\" aria-label=\"Move the whole melody down one octave\">↓ Octave</button><button id=\"octave-up\" class=\"secondary\" aria-label=\"Move the whole melody up one octave\">↑ Octave</button></div></div><p class=\"octave-hint\">Move all bars here, or use −8ve / +8ve below a bar. Your global octave setting carries over to new ideas.</p><p id=\"octave-status\" class=\"octave-status\" role=\"status\" aria-live=\"polite\"></p><div id=\"melody-notes\" class=\"melody-notes\"></div></section><section class=\"bass-panel\" aria-labelledby=\"bass-title\"><div class=\"melody-heading\"><div><h3 id=\"bass-title\">Give the bass its own movement</h3><p id=\"bass-help\">Four beats per bar · choose a note or rest.</p></div><button class=\"secondary\" id=\"reset-bass\">Reset unlocked bass</button></div><div id=\"bass-notes\" class=\"bass-notes\"></div></section></div></details><details id=\"tool-drums\" class=\"advanced-tool\"><summary><strong>Drums</strong><span>Grooves, swing and fills</span></summary><div class=\"tool-body\"><section class=\"drum-panel\" aria-labelledby=\"drum-title\"><div class=\"melody-heading\"><div><h3 id=\"drum-title\">Give it a groove</h3><p>16 steps per bar · tap to cycle off → hit → accent. Swipe the grid on smaller screens.</p></div></div><div class=\"drum-settings\"><label>Edit bar<select id=\"drum-bar\"></select></label><label>Preset<select id=\"drum-preset\"></select></label><button id=\"apply-drums\" class=\"secondary\">Apply to unlocked bars</button><label class=\"swing-label\">Swing <output id=\"swing-value\">0%</output><input id=\"drum-swing\" type=\"range\" min=\"0\" max=\"50\" value=\"0\" aria-label=\"Drum swing percentage\"></label></div><div class=\"drum-scroll\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"Drum step grid\"><div id=\"drum-grid\" class=\"drum-grid\"></div></div><div class=\"drum-actions\"><button id=\"drum-fill\" class=\"secondary\">Add fill to this bar</button><button id=\"clear-drums\" class=\"secondary\">Clear this bar</button><div id=\"drum-bar-lock\"></div></div><p id=\"drum-status\" class=\"tiny\" role=\"status\">Patterns repeat in each bar until you edit them. Drums are included in MIDI when enabled.</p></section></div></details><details id=\"tool-theme\" class=\"advanced-tool\"><summary><strong>Develop & arrange</strong><span>Choose notes, compare sections and change the song order</span></summary><div class=\"tool-body\"><section class=\"theme-studio\" aria-labelledby=\"theme-title\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">YOUR IDEA, DEVELOPED</span><h3 id=\"theme-title\">Develop my theme</h3><p>Capture a melody from your sketch, protect its favourite notes, and develop related sections. Rhythm and contour come from your theme; variations use musical rules, not a trained model.</p><div class=\"theme-source-controls\"><label>Theme starts at<select id=\"theme-start\"></select></label><label>Theme length<select id=\"theme-length\"></select></label><button id=\"theme-capture\" class=\"primary\">Capture my theme</button></div><p id=\"theme-summary\" class=\"tiny\"></p><details class=\"theme-protection\"><summary>Protect favourite notes</summary><p class=\"tiny\">Checked notes and locked melody bars keep their pitch, start, duration and velocity in developed versions.</p><div id=\"theme-protected\"></div></details><div class=\"theme-source-controls\"><label>Develop as<select id=\"theme-kind\"><option value=\"verse\">Verse · space and restraint</option><option value=\"chorus\">Chorus · lift the hook</option><option value=\"bridge\">Bridge · contrast and return</option><option value=\"ending\">Ending · settle and resolve</option></select></label><button id=\"theme-develop\" class=\"primary\" disabled>Develop / another alternative</button><button id=\"theme-original\" class=\"secondary\" disabled>Listen to original</button><button id=\"theme-keep-original\" class=\"secondary\">Keep original as a section</button><button id=\"theme-stop\" class=\"secondary\">Stop preview</button></div><div id=\"theme-candidate\" class=\"theme-candidate\" hidden><h4 id=\"theme-candidate-title\"></h4><p id=\"theme-candidate-detail\" class=\"tiny\"></p><button id=\"theme-listen\" class=\"secondary\">Listen to alternative</button><button id=\"theme-keep\" class=\"primary\">Keep this section</button></div><h4>Your kept sections</h4><div id=\"theme-sections\" class=\"theme-sections\"></div><div class=\"song-heading\"><h4>Song timeline</h4><button id=\"song-template\" class=\"secondary\">Arrange a song for me</button></div><p class=\"tiny\">Add kept sections, repeat them, move them, and shape their energy. Energy adjusts dynamics; protected locks still apply. Up to 32 bars. Add drums to your source theme if you want drum variations.</p><div id=\"song-timeline\" class=\"song-timeline\"></div><p id=\"song-summary\" class=\"tiny\"></p><div class=\"theme-card-actions\"><button id=\"song-preview\" class=\"secondary\" disabled>Listen to song arrangement</button><button id=\"song-build\" class=\"primary\" disabled>Build song in editor</button></div><p class=\"tiny\">Build replaces the working sketch with the arrangement and supports Undo. The captured theme and kept sections stay saved on this device. Use the main Play and Export MIDI controls after building.</p><p id=\"theme-status\" class=\"tiny\" role=\"status\"></p></section></div></details><details id=\"tool-expression\" class=\"advanced-tool\"><summary><strong>Expression & patterns</strong><span>Dynamics, timing, articulation and melody design</span></summary><div class=\"tool-body\"><div class=\"pattern-settings\"><label>Chord style<select id=\"chordStyle\"></select></label><label>Bass style<select id=\"bassStyle\"></select></label><label>Melody style<select id=\"melodyStyle\"></select></label></div><section class=\"expression-panel\" aria-labelledby=\"expression-title\"><div class=\"expression-heading\"><div><h3 id=\"expression-title\">Shape the performance</h3><p>Draw a crescendo, soften a phrase ending, or gently slow the final bar.</p></div></div><div class=\"expression-settings\"><label>Curve<select id=\"curve-kind\"><option value=\"dynamicCurve\">Dynamics</option><option value=\"tempoCurve\">Tempo</option></select></label><label>View range<select id=\"curve-page\"></select></label><label>Whole-sketch preset<select id=\"curve-preset\"><option value=\"\">Choose…</option><option value=\"swell\">Phrase swells / gentle slowdown</option><option value=\"rise\">Crescendo / gentle slowdown</option><option value=\"flat\">Reset to flat</option></select></label></div><p id=\"curve-label\" class=\"tiny\"></p><svg id=\"expression-curve\" viewBox=\"0 0 780 200\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Editable expression curve. Draw with a finger or mouse, or use the beat and value controls below.\"></svg><div class=\"expression-settings\"><label>Point<select id=\"curve-beat\"></select></label><label>Value (%)<input id=\"curve-value\" type=\"number\" min=\"25\" max=\"150\" value=\"100\" step=\"1\"></label><button id=\"curve-set\" class=\"secondary\">Set point</button></div><div class=\"expression-settings\"><label>Chord articulation<select id=\"articulation-chords\"><option value=\"natural\">As written</option><option value=\"connected\">Connected</option><option value=\"detached\">Detached</option><option value=\"accented\">Beat accents</option></select></label><label>Melody articulation<select id=\"articulation-melody\"><option value=\"natural\">As written</option><option value=\"connected\">Connected</option><option value=\"detached\">Detached</option><option value=\"accented\">Beat accents</option></select></label><label>Bass articulation<select id=\"articulation-bass\"><option value=\"natural\">As written</option><option value=\"connected\">Connected</option><option value=\"detached\">Detached</option><option value=\"accented\">Beat accents</option></select></label></div><p class=\"tiny\">Dynamics shape note velocities. Dynamics and articulation respect locks unless “Apply feel to locked parts too” is on. Tempo moves the whole band together. Curves and articulation carry into MIDI; your written notes stay editable.</p><p id=\"expression-status\" class=\"tiny\" role=\"status\"></p></section><section class=\"phrase-builder\" aria-labelledby=\"phrase-builder-title\"><h3 id=\"phrase-builder-title\">Make it a phrase</h3><p>Repeat a small melodic idea, answer it, then land on a held chord tone. Locked melody bars stay as you made them.</p><div class=\"phrase-builder-settings\"><label>Melody design<select id=\"phraseMode\"><option value=\"hmmExplore\">HMM · Explore</option><option value=\"hmm\">HMM · Coherent (Viterbi)</option><option value=\"motif\">Motif &amp; answer</option><option value=\"simple\">Simple sketch</option></select></label><label>Shape<select id=\"phraseShape\"><option value=\"arch\">Rise then fall</option><option value=\"rise\">Rising</option><option value=\"fall\">Falling</option><option value=\"steady\">Steady hook</option></select></label><label>Space<select id=\"phraseDensity\"><option value=\"space\">Leave room</option><option value=\"balanced\">Balanced</option><option value=\"busy\">More movement</option></select></label><label>Phrase length<select id=\"phraseLength\"><option value=\"4\">4 bars</option><option value=\"8\">8 bars</option></select></label><label>Tension<select id=\"phraseTension\"><option value=\"safe\">Chord tones</option><option value=\"passing\">Passing notes</option><option value=\"spicy\">Chromatic pull</option></select></label></div><div class=\"phrase-builder-actions\"><button id=\"expressive-phrase\" class=\"primary\">Try an expressive phrase</button><button id=\"generate-phrase\" class=\"secondary\">Generate melody phrase</button><button id=\"vary-endings\" class=\"secondary\">Vary the endings</button><button id=\"smooth-voicings\" class=\"secondary\">Smooth chord changes</button><button id=\"reset-voicings\" class=\"secondary\">Reset voicings</button></div><p class=\"tiny\">For bass movement, choose Diatonic approaches or Chromatic approaches above. Edited bass bars keep their pitches; use “Use style” on a bar to rebuild it. Smoothing changes unlocked chord inversions and octaves.</p><div class=\"human-feel-controls\"><label>Preview sound<select id=\"sound-palette\"><option value=\"soundfont\">SoundFont instruments</option><option value=\"studio\">Piano &amp; plucked bass</option><option value=\"classic\">Classic tones</option></select></label><label>Band response <output id=\"band-response-value\">0%</output><input id=\"band-response\" type=\"range\" min=\"0\" max=\"100\" step=\"1\" value=\"0\" aria-label=\"Band response percentage\"></label><button id=\"try-band\" class=\"secondary\">Try responsive band</button></div><p class=\"tiny\">Bass and hats leave space under busy melodies; kick supports nearby bass attacks, and drums answer phrase gaps. Response affects playback and MIDI, while locked accompaniment stays exact. Piano and bass sounds are synthesized locally; MIDI uses the instruments in your music app.</p><p id=\"band-status\" class=\"tiny\" role=\"status\"></p><div class=\"human-feel-controls\"><label>Human feel <output id=\"human-feel-value\">0%</output><input id=\"human-feel\" type=\"range\" min=\"0\" max=\"60\" step=\"1\" value=\"0\" aria-label=\"Human performance feel percentage\"></label><button id=\"new-performance\" class=\"secondary\">New performance variation</button><label class=\"import-check\"><input id=\"feel-locked\" type=\"checkbox\"> Apply feel to locked parts too</label></div><p class=\"tiny\">Human feel adds subtle timing, accents and note-length variation to playback and MIDI. Written notes stay unchanged. HMM modes plan phrase roles using hand-tuned probabilities; Explore samples alternatives, Coherent uses Viterbi. This model has not been trained on human performances.</p><p id=\"phrase-builder-status\" class=\"tiny\" role=\"status\"></p></section></div></details><details id=\"tool-keep\" class=\"advanced-tool\"><summary><strong>Keep & copy</strong><span>Locks and copying phrases</span></summary><div class=\"tool-body\"><section class=\"phrase-panel\" aria-labelledby=\"phrase-title\"><h3 id=\"phrase-title\">Keep the good bits</h3><p>Locks keep notes and voicings when you generate or copy. You can still edit locked parts by hand.</p><div class=\"part-locks\"><label><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"lock-chords\"> Keep all chords</label><label><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"lock-bass\"> Keep all bass</label><label><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"lock-melody\"> Keep all melody</label><label><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"lock-drums\"> Keep all drums</label></div><div class=\"copy-controls\"><label>Copy from<select id=\"copy-from\"></select></label><label>Length<select id=\"copy-length\"></select></label><label>Copy to<select id=\"copy-to\"></select></label><label>Parts<select id=\"copy-part\"><option value=\"all\">All parts</option><option value=\"chords\">Chords</option><option value=\"bass\">Bass</option><option value=\"melody\">Melody</option><option value=\"drums\">Drums</option></select></label><button class=\"secondary\" id=\"copy-phrase\">Copy phrase</button></div><p class=\"tiny\" id=\"phrase-status\" role=\"status\"></p></section></div></details><details id=\"tool-import\" class=\"advanced-tool\"><summary><strong>Import audio</strong><span>Turn a recording into editable notes</span></summary><div class=\"tool-body\"><section class=\"audio-import-panel\" aria-labelledby=\"import-title\"><h3 id=\"import-title\">Turn a recording into a phrase</h3><p>For clean humming or one instrument playing one note at a time. Estimates need checking, especially octaves. Audio is analysed on this device.</p><label class=\"file-label\">Choose audio or video <input id=\"import-file\" type=\"file\" accept=\"audio/*,video/*,.wav,.mp3,.m4a,.aac,.flac,.mp4,.mov,.m4v,.webm\"></label><p class=\"tiny\">Audio up to 20 MB · video up to 100 MB · 3 minutes maximum · analyse a section up to 20 seconds. MP4 / MOV with AAC sound are good video starting points. Video audio is extracted on this device; codec support depends on your browser.</p><audio id=\"source-audio\" controls hidden></audio><div class=\"import-settings\"><label>Use as<select id=\"import-part\"><option value=\"melody\">Melody</option><option value=\"bass\">Bass</option></select></label><label>Clip start (seconds)<input id=\"clip-start\" type=\"number\" min=\"0\" step=\".01\" value=\"0\"></label><label>Clip end (seconds)<input id=\"clip-end\" type=\"number\" min=\"0\" step=\".01\" value=\"20\"></label><label>Recording tempo (BPM)<input id=\"recording-tempo\" type=\"number\" min=\"50\" max=\"160\" value=\"86\"></label><label>Snap timing<select id=\"import-grid\"><option value=\"120\">1/16 notes</option><option value=\"240\">1/8 notes</option><option value=\"0\">Original timing</option></select></label></div><p class=\"tiny\">Recording tempo defines the beat grid. Once applied, notes play at your sketch’s tempo.</p><label class=\"import-check\"><input id=\"align-import\" type=\"checkbox\" checked> Align the first detected note to the start of the phrase</label><div class=\"import-actions\"><button id=\"preview-source\" class=\"secondary\">Listen to selected clip</button><button id=\"analyse-import\" class=\"primary\" disabled>Analyse notes</button><button id=\"cancel-import\" class=\"secondary\" hidden>Cancel analysis</button></div><p id=\"import-status\" class=\"tiny\" role=\"status\">Choose an audio file to begin.</p><div id=\"import-review\" hidden><h4>Review the estimated notes</h4><p id=\"import-summary\" class=\"tiny\"></p><div class=\"import-actions\"><button id=\"preview-import\" class=\"secondary\" disabled>Listen to notes</button><button id=\"stop-import-preview\" class=\"secondary\">Stop preview</button><button id=\"review-octave-down\" class=\"secondary\">↓ Octave</button><button id=\"review-octave-up\" class=\"secondary\">↑ Octave</button></div><div class=\"note-table-scroll\"><table class=\"note-table\"><thead><tr><th>Pitch</th><th>Start beat (from 0)</th><th>Length (beats)</th><th>Signal</th><th></th></tr></thead><tbody id=\"import-note-rows\"></tbody></table></div><div class=\"apply-import-settings\"><label>Start at<select id=\"import-bar\"></select></label><label class=\"import-check\"><input id=\"extend-import\" type=\"checkbox\" checked> Extend sketch if needed</label><label class=\"import-check\"><input id=\"lock-import\" type=\"checkbox\" checked> Lock imported bars</label><button id=\"apply-import\" class=\"primary\" disabled>Apply reviewed notes</button></div><p class=\"tiny\">Replaces the selected part in unlocked destination bars, including rests. Chords, drums and the other line stay as they are. Add new bars by repeating the last chord when needed.</p></div></section></div></details><details id=\"tool-help\" class=\"advanced-tool\"><summary><strong>Using MIDI in GarageBand</strong><span>Save, import and choose your instruments</span></summary><div class=\"tool-body\"><section class=\"instructions\"><h3>From sketch to song</h3><ol><li><span>01</span><div><strong>Save your MIDI file</strong><p>Tap Export MIDI, then use Download MIDI or choose Save to Files in the share menu.</p></div></li><li><span>02</span><div><strong>Bring it into GarageBand</strong><p>Set the song section to Automatic. Open the Loop Browser → Files → Browse items from the Files app, then drag the MIDI into Tracks view.</p></div></li><li><span>03</span><div><strong>Give it your sound</strong><p>Set GarageBand to the same tempo. Pick instruments for the chord, bass, melody and drum tracks, then shape the idea into your song.</p></div></li></ol></section></div></details></div><div class=\"legacy-hidden\" hidden><button class=\"primary\" id=\"play\">▶ &nbsp; Listen to sketch</button><span id=\"time\" class=\"time\">0:00</span><div class=\"timeline\"><div id=\"progress\"></div></div></div></section><footer><span>Small beginnings. Good songs.</span><span>Audio stays on your device · Independent companion to GarageBand</span></footer></main></div><script src=\"hmm.js\"></script><script src=\"performance-model.js\"></script><script src=\"music.js?v=perform5\"></script><script src=\"theme-studio.js?v=perform5\"></script><script src=\"quick-song.js\"></script><script src=\"sound-engine.js\"></script><script src=\"sound-settings.js?v=banks4\"></script><script src=\"app.js?v=banks4\"></script><script src=\"note-editor.js\"></script><script src=\"video-audio.js\"></script><script src=\"audio-import.js?v=video7\"></script><script src=\"midi-export.js\"></script><script src=\"expression-editor.js?v=ipad2\"></script><script src=\"theme-editor.js\"></script><script src=\"simple-workflow.js?v=offline8\"></script><script src=\"bank-router.js\"></script><script src=\"sound-panel.js?v=banks4\"></script><script src=\"performance-panel.js\"></script><script src=\"fresh-start.js\"></script><script src=\"offline-app.js\"></script><script>document.addEventListener(\"dblclick\",function(event){event.preventDefault();});</script></body></html>\n"}